{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘不知道靠什么安下心’解释成原有依靠也随之消失。原稿只说他找不到安定的凭借，并未明确原有依靠已经消失。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把‘不敢多想开心的事’解释成‘压抑美好回忆也没有让他好受多少’，原稿没有表达压抑回忆无效，反而写到旧日记忆重新有了温度。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"感受概括为留恋、克制、清醒、谨慎，漏掉了原稿明确写出的害怕独自承担困难，以及向前迈步后心里稍微放松的变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事高度一致：他离开了既有亲近也有委屈的熟悉生活，在怀念、孤独和是否回头之间反复挣扎，最终接受美好与伤害都真实存在，不再为了找回陪伴而委屈自己，带着想念继续生活，也愿意等待新的亲近。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "966895b3-ce2a-48eb-8ffc-fe79c00d3d57", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T125640449089Z", "elapsed_seconds": 170.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T12:59:31.007947+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history